        "text" => "(W regexp) (only under C<S<use feature 'enhanced_xx'>>)\nYour pattern contains an unescaped, unquoted C<#> character inside a\ncomment.  This warning is intended to catch cases where the first C<#>\nwas intended to be taken as a literal, but instead it and the rest of\nthe line are slurped up as a comment, leading to very unintended\nbehavior.  If the earlier C<#> wasn't intended to begin a comment,\nchange it to C<\\#>; otherwise quote or escape the second C<#> to\nsuppress the message.\n\n"
      },
      {
