        "text" => "(F) In a regular expression, you said something like\n\n (?[ [ \\xBEEF ] ])\n\nPerl isn't sure if you meant this\n\n (?[ [ \\x{BEEF} ] ])\n\nor if you meant this\n\n (?[ [ \\x{BE} E F ] ])\n\nYou need to add either braces or blanks to disambiguate.\n\n"
